  function Start-SystemIconFileButtonClick
  {
  <#
    .SYNOPSIS
      Click Event for the SystemIconFile Button Control
    .DESCRIPTION
      Click Event for the SystemIconFile Button Control
    .PARAMETER Sender
       The Button Control that fired the Click Event
    .PARAMETER EventArg
       The Event Arguments for the Button Click Event
